---
title: Preorder & Pickup — Things 4 Good
description: Order Things 4 Good candles online before the sale and pick them up anytime at the sale, or have them delivered at SPS. How ordering, pickup and payment work.
card:
  kicker: "Sale logistics"
  name: "Preorder, pickup, and payment."
  summary: "Order online before the sale, pick them up at the sale, and pay however is easiest."
  photo: preorder
---
{% extends "base.njk" %}

{% block content %}

<!-- ============================ HEADER ============================ -->
<section class="section page-head" id="head">
  <div class="hero-glow" aria-hidden="true"></div>
  <div class="wrap">
    <a class="back-link" href="/">&larr; Things 4 Good</a>
    <p class="eyebrow">Sale logistics</p>
    <h1 style="font-family:var(--serif);font-weight:500;font-size:clamp(2.4rem,5.4vw,4rem);letter-spacing:-.02em;line-height:1.02;max-width:18ch">Preorder, pickup, and payment.</h1>
    <p class="lead" style="margin-top:18px">{% if orders.preorder %}Online orders for the {{ site.saleYear }} sale are open through {{ orders.closesDay }}. Pick your scents, send your donation, and pick them up at the sale.{% elif orders.after %}The {{ site.saleYear }} sale is over, and the candles we have left are online through {{ orders.closesDay }}.{% elif orders.paused %}Online orders are paused while we run the sale and count what&rsquo;s left. They reopen {{ orders.reopens or "soon" }} with whatever we have.{% else %}Online orders open about a week before the fall sale. Candle Fundraiser subscribers hear first.{% endif %}</p>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- ============================ PREORDER ============================ -->
<section class="section" id="preorder" style="padding-top:clamp(20px,3vw,32px)">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="sec-head reveal">
      <p class="eyebrow">Order ahead</p>
      <h2 class="t">Order before the sale.</h2>
      <p class="lead">Lots of people buy candles as gifts, and ordering ahead sets your scents aside before anything sells out. {% if orders.preorder %}The <a href="/order/" data-tinylytics-event="order.link" data-tinylytics-event-value="preorder-head" style="color:var(--marigold-d);font-weight:600;text-decoration:none">order form</a> is open through {{ orders.closesDay }}.{% else %}Online orders open about a week before the sale, and subscribers hear first.{% endif %} Just getting a couple? Come by the sale, no order needed.{% if not orders.goldenTicket %} Golden Tickets are at the sale, or email us to set one aside.{% endif %}</p>
    </div>

    <div class="steps">
      <div class="step reveal">
        <div class="num">1</div>
        {% if orders.preorder %}<h3>Order online</h3>
        <p>Choose your scents and how many of each, and leave your name and email. Then send your donation the way that&rsquo;s easiest.</p>
        {% else %}<h3>Watch for the email</h3>
        <p>We&rsquo;ll tell Candle Fundraiser subscribers when online orders open, about a week before the sale.</p>{% endif %}
      </div>
      <div class="step alt reveal">
        <div class="num">2</div>
        <h3>We pour &amp; prep</h3>
        <p>We pour your candles, let them cure and add Mazie&rsquo;s labels, then set them aside with your name on them.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="step reveal">
        <div class="num">3</div>
        <h3>Pick up at the sale</h3>
        <p>Collect your order anytime during the sale, <b>{{ site.saleDates | safe }}</b>, or have it delivered at work if you&rsquo;re on the SPS team. Online orders are divided evenly across the four causes, or across the ones you leave checked on the form.</p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="mn-band reveal" style="margin-top:clamp(28px,4vw,40px)">
      <div class="glow" aria-hidden="true"></div>
      <div class="mn-copy">
        <span class="tag">{% if orders.open %}Order form &middot; open through {{ orders.closesDay }}{% else %}Order form{% endif %}</span>
        <h3>Ready to order?</h3>
        <p>{% if orders.preorder %}Pick your scents and send your donation, and we&rsquo;ll have them ready at the sale.{% elif orders.after %}The candles left from the sale are online, for pickup or SPS delivery.{% else %}Online orders open about a week before the sale and for a week after it. Subscribers hear first.{% endif %}</p>
      </div>
      <div class="mn-act">
        {% if orders.open %}
        <a class="btn btn--primary" href="/order/" data-tinylytics-event="order.link" data-tinylytics-event-value="preorder-steps">Open the order form <span class="arr">&rarr;</span></a>
        {% else %}
        <a class="btn btn--primary" href="{{ site.updatesUrl }}" data-tinylytics-event="updates.click" data-tinylytics-event-value="preorder-steps" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Get order updates <span class="arr">&rarr;</span></a>
        {% endif %}
        <span class="small">Or email <a href="mailto:{{ site.email }}" style="color:var(--marigold);font-weight:700">{{ site.email }}</a></span>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- ============================ PAYMENT ============================ -->
<section class="section section--paper2" id="payment">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="sec-head reveal">
      <p class="eyebrow">How to pay</p>
      <h2 class="t">Send your donation.</h2>
      <p class="lead">Each candle is a <b style="color:var(--ink)">$25 donation</b>. Pay whatever way is easiest. Venmo is the most popular. On a phone, tap to open the app. On a computer, scan a code. For an online order, please send it soon after you order.</p>
    </div>

    {% include "payment-methods.njk" %}

    <div class="good-note reveal" style="margin-top:clamp(28px,4vw,40px)">
      <span class="hand" style="font-size:1.7rem">100% &mdash; for real.</span>
      <span style="font-weight:500;color:var(--pine-d)">We pay for the materials ourselves, so everything you send becomes a donation. Online orders are divided evenly across this year&rsquo;s four causes, or across the ones you leave checked on the form. An uneven split is for purchases at the sale.</span>
    </div>

    <div class="sumstrip reveal" style="margin-top:clamp(22px,3vw,32px)">
      <div class="s acc"><b>$25</b><span>One candle</span></div>
      <div class="s"><b>$150</b><span>A batch of 6</span></div>
      <div class="s"><b>$250</b><span>Ten candles</span></div>
      <div class="s acc2"><b>100%</b><span>To charity</span></div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- ============================ CTA ============================ -->
<section class="section section--pine subscribe" id="cta">
  <div class="wrap">
    <p class="eyebrow" style="justify-content:center">Questions before you order?</p>
    <h2 class="t" style="max-width:20ch;margin-inline:auto">We&rsquo;re happy to help.</h2>
    <p class="lead" style="margin:18px auto 0;text-align:center">Get the fall announcement, read the common questions, or just email us. A real Thing will answer.</p>
    <div class="sub-form" style="max-width:none;gap:12px">
      <a class="btn btn--primary" href="{{ site.updatesUrl }}" data-tinylytics-event="updates.click" data-tinylytics-event-value="preorder-close" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Get sale updates <span class="arr">&rarr;</span></a>
      <a class="btn btn--ghost" href="/faq/">Read the FAQ</a>
      <a class="btn btn--ghost" href="mailto:{{ site.email }}">Email us</a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

{% endblock %}
